nit: if you rename props in Emotion components, it's a good opportunity to prefix them with `$`. That ensures they don't get sent to the DOM element and it helps us read our code, e.g.

```ts
const RowHeader = styled.div<{ $isNavigationDisabled: boolean }>(
  ({ theme, $isNavigationDisabled }) => ({
    display: 'flex',
    '&:hover': $isNavigationDisabled ? {} : { background: theme.background.hoverable },
  })
);
